### Soil (OpenLandMap) — original doc's endpoint, confirmed broken (404)
GET https://api.openlandmap.org/query/soil/taxousda?lon=79.465273&lat=18.090829

###

### Soil (OpenLandMap) — corrected endpoint, old exact filename (400 - file not found)
GET https://api.openlandmap.org/query/point?lat=18.090829&lon=79.465273&coll=predicted250m&regex=sol_grtgroup_usda.soiltax_c_250m_b0..0cm_1950..2017_v0.1.tif

###

### Soil (OpenLandMap) — broadened regex attempt (test this one)
GET https://api.openlandmap.org/query/point?lat=18.090829&lon=79.465273&coll=predicted250m&regex=grtgroup

